WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.600
The Career Leap Dashboard.

2
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.560
Job search on a schedule.

3
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.670
One system, from job ad to monthly retro.

4
00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:11.770
Every week, AI screens new roles against the same five must-haves,

5
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.610
then scores survivors against the CV.

6
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:19.400
The system recommends Pursue, Reserve, or Fail.

7
00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.570
A human makes the final call.

8
00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:26.960
Hiring personas, built on data, show what each manager needs.

9
00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.630
So applications speak to their problem.

10
00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.850
The funnel shows which stage loses roles.

11
00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:37.640
Each month, findings become experiments.

12
00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.100
Weekly audits catch mismatches.

13
00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:43.360
A human approves before the dashboard changes.

14
00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:47.470
The Career Leap Dashboard by Chantell Collins.

15
00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:50.380
Built in Claude Cowork and ClickUp.
